0032:     Rule:
0033:     - The marker location is distance 0 and keeps the marker color.
0034:     - Each step of Manhattan distance away from the marker advances one position
0035:       through the cycle green, yellow, black, grey, red, teal, maroon, pink, blue.
0036:     - Fill every pixel of the original grid by this distance-indexed cycle.
